{"name":"Colored / circle contact lenses","deep":true,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Multipel_colored_pencils_14.jpg/960px-Multipel_colored_pencils_14.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Multipel_colored_pencils_14.jpg","caption":"Multipel colored pencils 14","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},"mentions":18,"casual":{"lead":["Coloured and circle lenses are cosmetic contacts that change the look of the iris, either by tinting it or by adding a ring that makes the eye appear larger. In forums they are mostly used to lighten dark eyes.","No studies were found that measure whether they raise perceived attractiveness, so the appearance benefit rests on user reports."],"sections":[{"h":"How it works","paras":["A printed pigment layer on the lens covers or modifies the iris colour, and circle lenses add a darker or larger outer rim to enlarge the visible iris."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks and caveats","paras":["The FDA classes decorative lenses as medical devices needing a prescription and lists corneal abrasion, allergy, reduced vision and infection that can lead to blindness. A case report notes that some circle lenses contain metals that can matter during MRI."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Multipel_colored_pencils_14.jpg/960px-Multipel_colored_pencils_14.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/Multipel_colored_pencils_14.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Multipel colored pencils 14","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","creator":"Jonatan Svensson Glad","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Multipel_colored_pencils_14.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Multiple_colored_pencils_06.jpg/960px-Multiple_colored_pencils_06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a4/Multiple_colored_pencils_06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Multiple colored pencils 06","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","creator":"Jonatan Svensson Glad","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Multiple_colored_pencils_06.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Multiple_colored_pencils_01.jpg/960px-Multiple_colored_pencils_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/01/Multiple_colored_pencils_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Multiple colored pencils 01","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","creator":"Jonatan Svensson Glad","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Multiple_colored_pencils_01.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Multiple_colored_pencils_07.jpg/960px-Multiple_colored_pencils_07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d1/Multiple_colored_pencils_07.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","title":"Multiple colored pencils 07","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","creator":"Jonatan Svensson Glad","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Multiple_colored_pencils_07.jpg","source":"Wikimedia Commons"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Chile%2C_administrative_divisions_-_de_-_colored_2018.svg/960px-Chile%2C_administrative_divisions_-_de_-_colored_2018.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","full":"https://upload.wikimedi